  "statement": "A sequence satisfies $u_{1}=1$ and $u_{n+1}=u_{n}+n$ for $n\\\\ge 1$. Find a closed formula for $u_{n}$.",
  "solution": "$u_{n}=u_{1}+\\\\sum_{k=1}^{n-1}k=1+\\\\tfrac{(n-1)n}{2}=\\\\tfrac{n^{2}-n+2}{2}$. Check: $u_{1}=1$, $u_{2}=2$, $u_{3}=4$, $u_{4}=7$, agreeing with the recurrence.",
